    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/poem-cunju-intro.mp3",
    "text": "酥酥，我们一起读一读《村居》吧！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-parents-line-1.mp3",
    "text": "父母呼，应勿缓。父母命，行勿懒。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-parents-line-2.mp3",
    "text": "父母教，须敬听。父母责，须顺承。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-parents-question.mp3",
    "text": "妈妈叫你吃饭了，你可以怎么回应？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-parents-answer.mp3",
    "text": "先回应，再把手里的事情收好。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-parents-intro.mp3",
    "text": "酥酥，我们听一听，再想想生活里可以怎么做。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-daily-line-1.mp3",
    "text": "冬则温，夏则庆。晨则醒，昏则定。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-daily-line-2.mp3",
    "text": "出必告，反必面。居有常，业无变。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-daily-question.mp3",
    "text": "准备和爸爸出门玩，可以先做什么？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-daily-answer.mp3",
    "text": "告诉家人自己的去向，让大家放心。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-daily-intro.mp3",
    "text": "酥酥，我们听一听，再想想生活里可以怎么做。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-small-things-line-1.mp3",
    "text": "事虽小，勿擅为。苟擅为，子道亏。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-small-things-line-2.mp3",
    "text": "物虽小，勿私藏。苟私藏，亲心伤。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-small-things-question.mp3",
    "text": "捡到同学的小玩具，你可以怎么做？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-small-things-answer.mp3",
    "text": "玩具虽然小，也要尊重它的主人。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-small-things-intro.mp3",
    "text": "酥酥，我们听一听，再想想生活里可以怎么做。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
